* BSIM4 v4.8 model cards for the rspice bsim4v8 oracle decks.
* Parameter values written for this test suite (not a foundry deck); they
* exercise the short-channel Vth chain, DITS, mobMod 0/1, Rds(V), GIDL,
* substrate current, the diode/TAT card and the CTM charge path.
* Keep in sync with tests.rs::nmos45()/pmos90().

.model n45 nmos level=54 version=4.8
+ tnom=27 toxe=1.4e-9 toxp=1.0e-9 toxm=1.4e-9 toxref=1.4e-9 epsrox=3.9
+ xj=1.4e-8 ndep=3.0e18 nsd=2.0e20 ngate=1.0e23
